{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y的感受词组明显更密，部分屏幕同时出现多组意象，第一次观看时容易来不及消化；X的左右分栏更稳定，扫读负担更小。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y虽然更密，但【】加亮让人物每一阶段的心理重点更容易被迅速抓住，尤其是从害怕暴露心意、确认对方没有退开，到产生相互依靠的希望、害怕失去，最后接受不确定性，情绪推进比较完整。Y的感受还通过音乐出现的时机、身体反应和细微情绪变化，把甜蜜、惶惑、酸楚与释然区分得更具体，不只是笼统地说高兴或难过。X的优势是版面稳定、叙述顺畅，但在重点突出和音乐与心理的细腻对应上，整体不如Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d8c9e409-01e7-4745-8431-baa8d58f6ed4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T053150144695Z", "elapsed_seconds": 95.219, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T05:33:25.370882+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b5655e379ba6a9e1f490448cfb04e19de6162956100d0b848bafbf5de6d09b17", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt